<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Compresses the executable produced by the build (Delphi 7, Delphi/RAD
  Studio, .NET, etc.) using <a href="https://upx.github.io/">UPX</a>. UPX is
  downloaded on demand from the official releases and verified by SHA-256,
  matching the OS/architecture of the node the build runs on.
</div>
